@node Cap01 "Introduction"
  =======================================================================
  5D-User is a command which allows the users to see the stats of all
  people online at the bbs!
  =======================================================================
@endnode
@node Cap02 "Requirements"
  =======================================================================
  To install 5D-User you must have the following things:

    Programm     Location           Description
    ----------   --------           -----------
    5D-User Doors:5D-User Main program

  - an  Amiga Model (500/600/1000/1200/2000/2500/3000/4000/CDTV/CD³²)
  - the installed Version of OS\2, OS\3 or higher
    (Soft- or Hardware Version)
  - the installed .INFO Files in the directories.
  - AmiExpress V2.xx , v3.xx or higher.

  =======================================================================
@endnode
@node Cap03 "How to install 5D-User"
  =======================================================================
  To install 5D-User you must have all Requirement which were
  mentioned below. You need the following things.

  --------------------------
    Doors:5D-User (dir)
      ^^^ 5D-User
    BBS:Commands/BBSCmd (dir)
      ^^^ US.info
  --------------------------

  Decruch the 5D-User Archive. Go to your 'Doors:' Directory
  and make a Directory called '5D-User'. Copy '5D-User'
  into the Directory. Go to your 'BBS:Commands/BBSCmd/' Directory.
  Copy 'US.info' into it.
  =======================================================================
@endnode
